From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 23:11:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: Connected devices card hub

CONNECTIVITY_OTG_NFC_CAST_COMPATIBILITY_UX section 1: a card hub at the
top of Settings > Connected devices with USB / OTG, Bluetooth, NFC and
Cast cards in two rows. Each card is a focus target (arrows move, Enter
opens) with the Sable focus look (accent fill and border).

* State comes from Android each time the page resumes: USB (connected
  to a computer, drives mounted, OTG devices attached), Bluetooth on
  and connected devices, NFC on, Cast (Wi-Fi Display) available.
* Cards open Android's own pages: USB preferences when connected to a
  computer, Storage for USB drives (Files, eject), Bluetooth, NFC and
  Cast. Hardware the phone lacks says "Not on this phone" and is not
  focusable. The hub switches nothing itself.
* Pure model ConnectedHubCards with host tests.
